<package name="dsdcc" project="openSUSE:Factory">
  <title>Digital Speech Decoder (DSD) rewritten as a C++ library</title>
  <description>DSDcc is a complete rewrite from the original DSD (Digital Speech Decoder) project.
It provides a binary executable dsdccx and a library libdsdcc.so to be used in
other programs.
It decodes DMR, dPMR, D-Star and Yaesu System Fusion (YSF) standards

</description>
  <url>https://github.com/f4exb/dsdcc</url>
</package>
